    "description": "Visitors' camp, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. A traveller's camp: two striped green A-frame tents with open fronts and bedrolls, a canopy tent with a bed, an unlit fire in a stone ring with log seats, a cart, crates, a workbench, a camp table, a hitching rail, a woodpile and lantern posts; level 2 a cooking spit and pot, pennants and more lanterns; level 3 a red and white market awning, a welcome sign, cushions and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, cauldron, cornflower, dandelion, fern, oak_sign, oxeye_daisy, red_banner, red_wool, short_grass, white_wool. Decoration step adds: potted_plant, sign_text.",
